# Mi Óptica — Layout, Sidebar y Grid

## 1. Estructura HTML de Página
```html
<!-- layout.html — estructura base -->
<body class="app-layout">
  <nav  class="sidebar" th:replace="~{fragments/sidebar :: sidebar}"></nav>
  <main class="main-content">
    <header class="page-header">
      <h1 class="page-title" th:text="${pageTitle}">Módulo</h1>
    </header>
    <div th:replace="${content}"></div>
  </main>
</body>
```

## 2. Sidebar — Fragmento Canónico
```html
<!-- fragments/sidebar.html -->
<nav th:fragment="sidebar" class="sidebar" aria-label="Navegación principal">

  <div class="sidebar__logo-area">
    <!-- Logo animado (JS del ojo — no modificar) -->
  </div>

  <p class="sidebar__nav-label">Principal</p>

  <a th:each="item : ${navItems}"
     th:href="@{${item.url}}"
     class="sidebar__item"
     th:classappend="${currentPage == item.key} ? ' active'"
     th:aria-current="${currentPage == item.key} ? 'page' : null"
     sec:authorize="${item.role}">
    <svg aria-hidden="true" th:replace="~{icons/${item.icon}}"></svg>
    <span th:text="${item.label}"></span>
  </a>

  <!-- Items estáticos si no usas navItems dinámico -->
  <a th:href="@{/dashboard}" class="sidebar__item"
     th:classappend="${currentPage == 'dashboard'} ? ' active'"
     th:aria-current="${currentPage == 'dashboard'} ? 'page'">
    <svg aria-hidden="true"><!-- icono --></svg>
    <span>Dashboard</span>
  </a>
</nav>
```

## 3. Sidebar — CSS
```css
.sidebar {
  width: 240px; min-height: 100vh; background: var(--navy-900);
  padding: var(--sp-3) 0; display: flex; flex-direction: column;
  position: sticky; top: 0; align-self: flex-start;
}
.sidebar__logo-area {
  padding: 0 var(--sp-2) var(--sp-3);
  border-bottom: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,.08);
  margin-bottom: var(--sp-1);
}
.sidebar__nav-label {
  font-size: 10px; font-weight: 600; letter-spacing: .1em;
  text-transform: uppercase; color: rgba(255,255,255,.3);
  padding: var(--sp-2) var(--sp-2) var(--sp-1);
  margin: var(--sp-1) 0 0;
}
.sidebar__item {
  display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 10px;
  padding: 10px var(--sp-2); color: rgba(255,255,255,.6);
  font-size: var(--text-base); font-weight: 400;
  text-decoration: none; margin: 1px var(--sp-1);
  border-radius: var(--radius-md); position: relative;
  transition: background var(--dur-fast)   var(--ease-std),
              color       var(--dur-fast)   var(--ease-std),
              padding-left var(--dur-normal) var(--ease-std);
}
.sidebar__item:hover       { background: rgba(255,255,255,.07);
                             color: rgba(255,255,255,.9); padding-left: 22px; }
.sidebar__item:focus-visible{ outline: none;
                              box-shadow: 0 0 0 2px rgba(0,180,216,.6); }
/* Item activo — cyan sobre navy */
.sidebar__item.active      { background: var(--cyan-400); color: var(--navy-900);
                             font-weight: 600; padding-left: var(--sp-2); }
.sidebar__item.active svg  { color: var(--navy-900); }
```

## 4. Layout Principal — CSS
```css
.app-layout {
  display: flex; min-height: 100vh;
  background: var(--slate-50); font-family: var(--font-body);
  color: var(--slate-700);
}
.main-content {
  flex: 1; padding: var(--sp-5) var(--sp-6);
  max-width: 1280px; overflow-x: hidden;
}
.page-header  { margin-bottom: var(--sp-4); }
.page-title   { font-size: var(--text-2xl); font-weight: 700;
                color: var(--navy-900); margin: 0; }
.page-subtitle{ font-size: var(--text-base); color: var(--slate-500);
                margin-top: 4px; }
```

## 5. Grid Responsivo
```css
/* Contenedores de grid — siempre múltiplo de var(--sp-2) en gap */
.grid-2 { display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(2, 1fr); gap: var(--sp-2); }
.grid-3 { display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(3, 1fr); gap: var(--sp-2); }
.grid-4 { display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(4, 1fr); gap: var(--sp-2); }

/* Grid de KPIs del dashboard */
.kpi-grid { display: grid;
            grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(200px, 1fr));
            gap: var(--sp-2); margin-bottom: var(--sp-4); }

@media (max-width: 1024px) { .grid-4 { grid-template-columns: repeat(2,1fr); } }
@media (max-width: 768px)  { .grid-3, .grid-2 { grid-template-columns: 1fr; } }

/* Collapsar sidebar en móvil */
@media (max-width: 768px) {
  .sidebar { width: 64px; }
  .sidebar .sidebar__item span,
  .sidebar .sidebar__nav-label { display: none; }
}
```

## 6. Separadores y Espaciado de Sección
```html
<!-- Separador entre secciones de página -->
<hr class="section-divider">

<!-- Header de sección con acción -->
<div class="section-header">
  <h2 class="section-title">Ventas del día</h2>
  <button class="btn btn-secondary btn-sm">Exportar</button>
</div>
```
```css
.section-divider { border: none; border-top: 0.5px solid var(--slate-300);
                   margin: var(--sp-4) 0; }
.section-header  { display: flex; align-items: center;
                   justify-content: space-between; margin-bottom: var(--sp-3); }
.section-title   { font-size: var(--text-xl); font-weight: 600;
                   color: var(--navy-900); margin: 0; }
```

## 7. Skeleton Loader
```css
@keyframes shimmer {
  from { transform: translateX(-100%); }
  to   { transform: translateX(100%); }
}
.skeleton {
  background: var(--slate-200); border-radius: var(--radius-sm);
  position: relative; overflow: hidden;
}
.skeleton::after {
  content: ''; position: absolute; inset: 0;
  background: linear-gradient(90deg, transparent 0%, rgba(255,255,255,.75) 50%, transparent 100%);
  animation: shimmer 1.5s ease-in-out infinite;
}
.skeleton--text  { height: 14px; margin-bottom: 6px; }
.skeleton--title { height: 22px; width: 60%; }
.skeleton--card  { height: 120px; border-radius: var(--radius-lg); }
```
